@host=http://localhost:5000

### Root
GET {{host}}/

### V1 - Get users
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users

### V1 - Get user by id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/1

### V1 - Create user
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Diana"
}

### V2 - Get active users only
GET {{host}}/api/v2/users

### V2 - Get all users including inactive
GET {{host}}/api/v2/users?includeInactive=true

### V2 - Get user by id
GET {{host}}/api/v2/users/1

### V2 - Create user with email
POST {{host}}/api/v2/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Eve",
  "email": "eve@example.com"
}

### V2 - Deactivate user
DELETE {{host}}/api/v2/users/2

### V2 - Verify inactive users
GET {{host}}/api/v2/users?includeInactive=true
